fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"codecparsers/gstav1parser.html#gst_av1_parser_reference_frame_update","fragment":"\n\tgst_av1_parser_reference_frame_update\n\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.AV1Parser.prototype.reference_frame_update\n\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.AV1Parser.reference_frame_update\n\nUpdate the context of frame_header to parser's state. This function is\nused when we finish one frame's decoding/showing, and need to update info\nsuch as reference, global parameters.\nParameters:\nthe GstAV1Parser\na GstAV1FrameHeaderOBU to load\nThe GstAV1ParserResult.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.18\n\t\t\nUpdate the context of frame_header to parser's state. This function is\nused when we finish one frame's decoding/showing, and need to update info\nsuch as reference, global parameters.\nParameters:\nthe GstCodecParsers.AV1Parser\na GstCodecParsers.AV1FrameHeaderOBU to load\nThe GstCodecParsers.AV1ParserResult.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.18\n\t\t\nUpdate the context of frame_header to parser's state. This function is\nused when we finish one frame's decoding/showing, and need to update info\nsuch as reference, global parameters.\nParameters:\nthe GstCodecParsers.AV1Parser\na GstCodecParsers.AV1FrameHeaderOBU to load\nThe GstCodecParsers.AV1ParserResult.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.18\n\t\t\n"});